{"Title":"An Act pertaining to the estimated rate of inflation for social service programs","BillNumber":"H177","DocketNumber":"HD1589","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:40:13.937"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:40:13.9366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H177/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garry of Dracut, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 177) of Colleen M. Garry relative to the estimated rate of inflation for social service programs.  Children, Families and Persons with Disabilities.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law or regulation to the contrary, no increase above 200% of the previous year's rate increase shall be allowed as an estimated rate of inflation for social service programs under General Laws, Chapter 7, section 22N.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J13","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J13"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}